{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107948","id":2615898730,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6b63Jq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107948","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107948.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107948.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107948","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107948/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107948/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107948/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b58c6c829b9915bdd1d36f14d2ba96778f1f4dfc","number":107948,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Web] Fix Webkit leak caused by the position reporting audio worklets","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR reintroduces the pooling of `GodotPositionReportingProcessor` worklets. This is because Webkit doesn't seem to delete processors that return `false` in `process()`, [even if the specs says to do so](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102163#discussion_r1945897924). That made the memory explode and the Webkit engine reloading the games.\r\n\r\nThis PR also removes the `postMessage` limit on audio position worklet. [The tests](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105541#issuecomment-2828568538) made by @PizzaLovers007 seem to indicate that the partial reporting didn't achieve it's goals and was basically useless.\r\n\r\nHere's my iPad Pro M3 running a tweaked version of the #107390 MRP for more than 18 minutes straight.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1376\" alt=\"Audio Test 18m\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86f5dce8-2568-4b5a-963d-8a6b51a1be49\" />\r\n\r\nAt the 18 minutes mark, nothing seems to indicate that the MRP was taxing for my iPad, memory-wise nor processing-wise.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1237\" alt=\"Capture d’écran, le 2025-06-24 à 14 31 37\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d0987180-f94e-46e9-b251-534736482208\" />\r\n\r\nMRP: [audio-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20889786/audio-test.zip)\r\n\r\nFixes #107390.\r\nFixes #105397.\r\nSupersedes #105541. (added co-authorship)\r\nReverts the spirit of #102715.\r\nDoesn't seem to create a regression for #102505.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","na